{"seq":1,"slug":"product-philosophy","title":"产品哲学","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/ideas-and-methods/product-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"simplicity-and-focus","title":"简约与聚焦","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/ideas-and-methods/product-philosophy/simplicity-and-focus","wordCount":2074,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"technology-meets-liberal-arts","title":"科技与人文的交汇","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/ideas-and-methods/product-philosophy/technology-meets-liberal-arts","wordCount":2029,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 产品哲学\n\n乔布斯之所以能一次次缔造改变世界的产品，根源在于他独树一帜的产品哲学。本章剖析支撑其全部创造的两大核心理念。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"简约与聚焦\"——他如何以化繁为简的执着和对少数事物倾注全力的取舍智慧，追求终极的精致。第二篇文档讲述\"科技与人文的交汇\"，揭示他为何坚信伟大的产品诞生于技术与艺术、理性与人性的十字路口。\n"}